title: Entra ID Directory Enumeration
id: 9ab3b045-e18a-4991-b7c9-6c3b50fa33ab
status: experimental
description: Detects bulk directory enumeration in Entra ID via the Microsoft Graph or AzureAD/Az modules (Get-MgUser, Get-AzureADUser, az ad user list) returning large result sets, used to map identities and roles for targeting.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1087/004/
logsource:
  product: azure
  service: auditlogs
detection:
  selection:
    OperationName|contains:
      - 'List users'
      - 'List groups'
      - 'List service principals'
  timeframe: 10m
  condition: selection | count() by InitiatedBy > 50
  condition: selection
fields:
  - InitiatedBy
  - OperationName
falsepositives:
  - Identity governance and sync tooling
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.discovery
  - attack.t1087.004
